```
<header>
    <h1>🌳 Forest Conservation</h1>
    <p>Protect Nature Today for a Greener Tomorrow</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#forests">Save Forests</a>
    <a href="#wildlife">Wildlife</a>
    <a href="#sustainability">Sustainability</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="home">
    <h2>Our Forests, Our Future</h2>
    <p>
        Forests provide oxygen, protect wildlife, regulate the climate,
        and support life on Earth. Let us work together to protect them.
    </p>
    <h3>🌱 Plant Trees • Protect Wildlife • Save Our Planet 🌍</h3>
</section>

<main class="container">

    <section class="card" id="forests">
        <h2>🌲 Save Our Forests</h2>
        <p>
            Forests absorb carbon dioxide, help maintain rainfall,
            protect soil, and support millions of living organisms.
            Planting trees and preventing unnecessary tree cutting
            are important steps toward forest conservation.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="wildlife">
        <h2>🐅 Protect Wildlife</h2>
        <p>
            Forests are natural homes for tigers, elephants, birds,
            and countless other species. Protecting forest habitats
            helps prevent species extinction and preserves biodiversity.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
        <h2>🪓 Prevent Deforestation</h2>
        <p>
            Deforestation destroys habitats and contributes to climate
            change. We can help by reducing paper waste, recycling,
            supporting responsible forestry, and spreading awareness.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="sustainability">
        <h2>🌍 Environmental Sustainability</h2>
        <p>
            Sustainable living means using natural resources responsibly.
            Save water, reduce plastic waste, plant native trees,
            conserve energy, and encourage others to protect nature.
        </p>
    </section>

</main>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Forest Conservation Awareness Project</p>
    <p>Every Tree Matters. Every Action Counts.</p>
</footer>
